l":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108407#issuecomment-3533124474","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108407","id":3533124474,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SlzN6","user":{"login":"Reneator","id":24807557,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODA3NTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24807557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator","html_url":"https://github.com/Reneator","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T14:46:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T14:52:35Z","body":"Edit: Ok, i was actually able to boil it down to the existance of the \"RichtTextLabel\" in the element, so my MRP would be identical to the one by OP.\n\n<img width=\"354\" height=\"361\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ff013b05-83ab-4a2b-8c10-1cce79b59c57\" />\n\n> [@Reneator](https://github.com/Reneator) Can you share the problem scene as a MRP?\n\nI experimented a bit, but couldnt reduce it down to a simple structure without having to export half of the project. Couldnt reproduce it in a newly created MRP.\n\nBut i found a workaround for me, that \"Ignore Size\" actually has the same endresult for me, without the crashing/freezing. (Which is the same as changing the expand_mode to 1 shown further above)","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3533124474/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3533245661","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108407#issuecomment-3533245661","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108407","id":3533245661,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7SmQzd","user":{"login":"Reneator","id":24807557,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0ODA3NTU3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24807557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator","html_url":"https://github.com/Reneator","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reneator/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-14T15:16:23Z","updated_at":"2025-11-14T15:16:23Z","body":"Also:\nWhen playing around witht he repro project, i noticed that the layout of the elements is completely out of whack.\nAnd as soon as i set a minimal size for the textureRect it doesnt crash/freeze anymore.\n\nHer eis how its shown in v4.5.1.stable.official [f62fdbde1]\n\n<img width=\"1897\" height=\"571\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bae798aa-e1e9-4659-ad8a-e73f86f1ba1b\" />\n\nFrom my understanding the Texture_Rect should actually be encased by the HBoxContainer. so maybe this is a problem of the HBoxContainer, or its an interaction between the BoxContainers and the RichTextLabel, which interferes with the Scaling of the TextureRect?\n\nBecause if i change it to a VboxContainer, it looks like this, even though i set a min-size Y for the texture:\n\n<img width=\"1896\" height=\"622\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/15e7bb59-14a1-4de9-9856-cc4a5b47a12c\" />\n\nWhen i now deactivate the RichTextLabel, it is then able to properly \"calculate\" the size of the TextureRect\n\n<img width=\"1906\" height=\"650\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/af1e9d68-51b0-452c-a813-c1ca42e8f319\" />\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3533245661/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3541433850","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108407#issuecomment-3541433850","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108407","id":3541433850,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7TFf36","user":{"login":"xuhuisheng","id":1118508,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExMTg1MDg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1118508?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng","html_url":"https://github.com/xuhuisheng","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/xuhuisheng/subscriptions","organizations_url